cra://debug?suggest=dark%20mode
expect-log Cra suggest dark mode .*command\("appearanceDark"\) Switch to Dark Mode
cra://debug?suggest=night%20mode
expect-log Cra suggest night mode .*command\("appearanceDark"\) Switch to Dark Mode
cra://debug?suggest=light%20mode
expect-log Cra suggest light mode .*command\("appearanceLight"\) Switch to Light Mode
cra://action/appearanceDark
wait 1
cra://debug?themeShown=switched-dark
expect-log Cra theme shown switched-dark: space=Auto follows=1 theme=dark shell=dark sidebar=dark
